  "description": ".NET SDK for the AIArbitration API — an intelligent AI model router that\n      automatically selects the best model (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, and 100+\n      others) for every request based on cost, latency, and compliance.\n      Drop-in compatible with the OpenAI SDK: change one URL and keep your code.\n      v2.0 adds video generation (6 providers, 3 scoring modes), webhook management\n      (HMAC-signed, with delivery log), and file upload for document analysis and\n      vision (image attachment for GPT-4o, Claude Sonnet, Gemini, etc.).",
  "id": "AIArbitration.Client",
